  "Question": "Calculate the value of \\((-2)^{11}+(-2)^{10}\\).",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "-1024",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Factor out the common factor \\((-2)^{10}\\): \\((-2)^{10}\\times(-2+1)=1024\\times(-1)=-1024\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Evaluate each power\n\nEvaluate the powers before adding. Since the base is negative, the odd power is negative and the even power is positive:\n\\[\n(-2)^{11}+(-2)^{10}=-2048+1024=-1024.\n\\]",
